                                            <p>To calm the nerves after your skydive, Anantara Spa offers a luxurious Turkish Hammam. Turkish houses, or hammams, have been a crucial part of Ottoman culture for centuries. Choose from an array of rituals and unwind, whilst cleansing out toxins</p>
